.github
.claude
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
deploy/secrets
deploy/backup/rclone.conf
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/e2e/.auth
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
docs
backend
identity
